      "id": "t016089",
      "source": "N11. Time intervals and overlapping events",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016090",
      "source": "Problem 926. Overlapping historical intervals: case 1",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016091",
      "source": "Knowledge context.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016092",
      "source": "Historical periods often overlap rather than forming a single neat sequence.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016093",
      "source": "Given facts.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016094",
      "source": "Event A lasted from year 100 to 150. Event B lasted from 100 to 137. Treat intervals as continuous for this exercise.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016095",
      "source": "Rules.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016096",
      "source": "Two intervals overlap when max(start times) < min(end times). Overlap length = min(end times) − max(start times), if positive.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016097",
      "source": "Task.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016098",
      "source": "Did the events overlap? If so, for how many years?",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016099",
      "source": "Step-by-step solution.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016100",
      "source": "1. Later start=max(100,100)=100. 2. Earlier end=min(150,137)=137. 3. Difference=137−100=37.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016101",
      "source": "Answer.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016102",
      "source": "Yes, overlap 37 years.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016103",
      "source": "Knowledge takeaway.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016104",
      "source": "Interval reasoning distinguishes “before/after” from “overlapping in time.”",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016105",
      "source": "Formal model.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "t016106",
      "source": "Interval intersection; compute max starts and min ends.",
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
